// Uses staticFvMesh for testing AMR without mesh motion
// Note: dynamicMotionSolverFvMesh is incompatible with the functionObject
// approach because the motion solver's internal point data becomes stale
// after mesh topology changes. For combined mesh motion + AMR, use
// adaptiveFvMesh or a custom mesh type.
//
// AMR/LB is handled by the loadBalancedAMR functionObject in controlDict
dynamicFvMesh   staticFvMesh;


